# Witness for BulkCloseMeetsCoreClose. The check is replaced by FALSE, so the invariant fails
# exactly when a kept bulk-switch close is reachable.
MODULE: BulkCloseMeetsCoreCloseWitness
TARGET: BulkCloseMeetsCoreClose
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a bulk switch's close is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("BulkCloseMeetsCoreClose", CBulkClose)
--- REPLACE
Fails("BulkCloseMeetsCoreClose", FALSE)
--- END
